  "memo": "R08 holds because five accounts share the shipping address. Its household exception does not apply: the home-address registration is recent and the account count exceeds the exception limit. No other rule condition holds, and no earlier outcome settles the order. Linkage is the sole adverse family, so §6.6(b) applies and requires id_check. That check passed; §5.3(a) therefore requires clear and prohibits further adverse dispositions. Household sharing remains a plausible benign explanation despite not qualifying for the formal exception. No further check is required."
